Question 6: Select employees with salary equal to 40000.
Consider an employee table with the following fields:
id, name, salary, email, contact, address, and city.
If the table does not exist, create it.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This requirement focuses on finding employees whose salary exactly matches a specific value (40000).

Each employee has a salary field.

The condition checks whether the salary is exactly 40000.

Only those employees whose salary is precisely 40000 are included.

Employees with salary less than or greater than 40000 are excluded.
